=00_Af9rh6UNpVjy2bXn2Z5ncd5PugMg9fcvlZDjpRnyziaTMA&oe=6A2D66C2"}, {"file_name": "ss5.png", "id": "1715729295759342", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499305050_1715729299092675_4690986203494255387_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Ef4ZOYsMgAcQ7kNvwFw90ZO&_nc_oc=Ado_RfBnVWKeT0a4tAIiKQsLqKJ5lcmSChj0VXfVkJuD7VDDosnpPjLyyQ_c1rvuCo8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_G_ES-3nHCZ_ZTRoFVhpsrklkuGhy2f0RAR-j4joV7Dw&oe=6A2D5C3F"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Portrait.png", "id": "806605711863955", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823486_806605715197288_1898259061609879939_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=RXCjTGKKLW8Q7kNvwHHD8M4&_nc_oc=Adod1DMoADucHse689L29brMIHQaOE_1CLJylhnXBbRjDtbPknfYJGxsq08qReBh2AE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af8AzEKldh-aL4QZr7jG0et2JAbXa7a6rstbmhhFiXG3IQ&oe=6A2D6B30"}, "display_name": "Afterlife: Dead Zone", "keywords": ["zombies", "shooter", "disparos", "zombis", "horror"], "long_description": "In Afterlife: Dead Zone, you play as a soldier trapped in the Dead Zones, isolated areas where help seems impossible. Humanity teeters on the brink of extinction: ancient alien civilizations have returned to assess our development and, deeming us a threat, unleash weapons of mass destruction that turn people into bloodthirsty monsters.\n\nExplore dark, devastated post-apocalyptic environments where hordes of zombies and mutated creatures can appear around every corner. Your mission is simple but deadly: shoot and avoid dying. While your weapons have infinite ammo, the variety and ferocity of enemies will demand strategy and quick reflexes to survive.\n\nDesigned for Meta Quest, Afterlife: Dead Zone delivers an immersive experience where you can only move physically within your designated play area, plunging you into a dark, destructive, and oppressive world.", "short_descr